## Note
The 426 answer over TinyHttpd carries "Connection: Upgrade, close": the NaruServe 426 closes the connection, and TinyHttpd joins its own close token to the Upgrade token. The TinyHttpd adapter now returns Request.getHeaderEntries() as IR-HTTP-003 AC-1 requires, with no shortcut left in TinyHttpdExchange.
